node_modules/
.next/
out/
.open-next/
.wrangler/
# Cloudflare's local-secrets file for `wrangler dev` — same rule as .env*,
# never commit real values here.
.dev.vars*
# All .env* files are ignored except the checked-in template — see
# AGENTS.md ("Never commit secrets, API keys, or .env* files"). Also
# covers the no-dot spelling defensively (Next.js itself only auto-loads
# ".env.local", not "env.local" — but if a file by that name exists, it
# must never be trackable regardless of whether the app reads it).
.env*
!.env.example
env.local
env*.local
*.log
.DS_Store
prisma/*.db
*.tsbuildinfo
